when the original justice league hit  theaters in 2017  audiences found their fair share of  problems with it to say the least  for one there was the jumbled mishmash  of tones due to the film having two  directors  zack snyder and joss whedon each with  different visions of what the movie  should be  or how about the borderline  incomprehensible storytelling that  resulted from whedon cutting down  snyder's vision of a four-hour  epic into a two-hour cliff notes version  but none of justice league's flaws came  to embody the movie's failures quite as  well as superman's mustache  this is how it all went down when zack  snyder was at the helm during principal  photography in 2016  soup's actor henry cavill was clean  shaven when joss whedon was brought in  to direct his reshoots the following  year however cavill had already grown a  dastardly mustache for his villainous  role in mission impossible fallout  trouble was cavil was contractually  obligated to keep the mustache  fallout director christopher macquarie  later told empire that he actually did  give permission for cavill to shave  in exchange for three million dollars  from justice league's producers to cover  the costs of digitally filling in  cavill's upper lip but paramount  pictures executives balked at the  compromise and the responsibility of  henry cavill's facial hair management  fell  entirely on team justice league the  film's cgi artists did the best they  could to digitally shave him  but the end result looked well it looked  bad really  bad in the end the superman's mustache  fiasco came to symbolize the worst of  the 2017 cut of justice league and  perfectly demonstrated how all the money  in the world can cover up something that  just isn't going to work  everyone knows what happened next  justice league opened as a relative box  office flop  fans started the hashtag release the  snyder cup movement and warner media  finally gave snyder the money to release  his version of the movie on hbo max  zack snyder's justice league has  garnered a positive response too  and in recent days zack snyder has been  talking to the press about the  experience  as a whole snyder has refrained from  actually bad-mouthing the theatrical  version  but he is apparently relieved that  superman's weird cgi face doesn't  feature on the final version of the  character  asked about the mustache mishap by mtv  news snyder said that since he's never  seen whedon's version of the movie he's  never really gotten a good look at  smooth superman  he explained i've only seen it in memes  it was funny because part of me is happy  that we were able to have that not be  the total legacy of the hard work that  cavill had done over the last 10 years  you know  it's sad to think that could have been  the last view that people had of  superman  of course the man who was most affected  by the mustache fiasco was henry cavill  himself  luckily cavill has been a good sport  throughout the whole mustache saga  in 2017 he posted a photo from the set  of mission impossible fallout  and captioned it it is time to finally  set the record straight in this mustache  fiasco  pictured above is not a set on mi6 but  the latest in a series of weapons being  designed by warner brothers and  paramount studios to combat the entity  known as henry cavill's mustache  when the release the snyder cut movement  was building in 2019  cavill didn't say much about it publicly  and when he did he joked that  talking about justice league brought  back painful memories he even told  entertainment reporter jake hamilton  i miss my mustache which is the most  important thing and for me  it was just a harrowing reminder that i  didn't have it anymore and so i just  didn't want to dig that wound any deeper  but now that the snyder cut is out  cavill has returned to the justice  league fold  even posting a message of  congratulations to his director he wrote  on instagram  i couldn't be happier to see your vision  for justice league realized and what a  movie it is  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite movies are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]  you
 

